                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is a Steam version of quest game https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/Братья Пилоты:_По_следам_полосатого_слона (https://thevideogamedatabase.fandom.com/wiki/Pilots_Brothers:_On_the_Track_of_Striped_Elephant)\n\nGame was originally released on CD in 1997\n\nNoticed differences:\n1) Some puzzles are zoomed in for easier solving\n(Same difficulty but characters dont interact directly with puzzle)\n\nhttps://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3730832188\n https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3730832226\n\n2) One voice line seem to be missing\nhttps://steamcommunity.com/app/336760/discussions/0/834999271307669449/\n\n3) Fulqrum launcher. (What for?)\n\n4) Due to translation/localization - some speech was changed to fit audio length:\nhttps://steamcommunity.com/app/336760/discussions/0/834999523153544337/\n\nOverall I can definitely recommend this game if you like quests!",
